WEBVTT

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:10.540
<i>We, the members of Kakashi's Squad 7,</i>

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:13.570
<i>were on a first C-rank escort</i>
<i>mission in a while.</i>

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.950
<i>We were guarding Shibuki,</i>

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:19.970
<i>the young leader</i>
<i>of Village Hidden in the Waterfall.</i>

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:24.720
<i>His father was a fine man,</i>
<i>respected by everyone,</i>

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.980
<i>who had served as leader for many years.</i>

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:33.930
Those were just birds.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.560
Shut up! I know that!

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:43.860
<i>But this man, who had succeeded him,</i>
<i>is so undependable.</i>

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:48.040
<i>Really, how does he fulfill his duty</i>
<i>as leader of the Hidden Waterfall Village?</i>

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:58.520
Wow!

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:01.650
Look at that huge waterfall!

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.020
We've arrived...

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:13.560
So, this is the Village Hidden
in the Waterfall.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:19.930
<i>On a sunny day near the end of summer,</i>
<i>we gazed out at the waterfall.</i>

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:29.950
<i>At this time, we still believed that</i>
<i>our mission would be over quickly.</i>

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:35.860
Mission: Protect the Waterfall Village!

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:51.340
Master Shibuki!

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:52.330
Huh?

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:55.180
Welcome home! Master Shibuki!

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:57.310
Hey, don't come close!

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:59.300
I'm the village leader.

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:02.250
I don't have time to play with you.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:06.750
You're wrong, Master Shibuki.
We're going to clean up this area.

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:08.950
Mom told us to.

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:10.290
I see...

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:13.720
Then we'll get you some help.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.730
From the Ninja from Hidden Leaf Village.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:18.400
Huh? Hey! Wait a sec--!

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.600
We'll pay you! So take this on
as a part of your mission.

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:25.540
We're not handymen!
You've gotta be kidd--!

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:27.040
Thank you!

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:31.450
That'll really help! The current's
pretty strong, and it can be scary.

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:35.980
Huh... err... Kakashi Sensei!

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:38.680
We'll be glad to help, Shibuki.

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:42.180
Although we'll be sending you
another invoice.

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:45.090
Hey, are we done escorting you?

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:47.730
Yes, this is far enough.

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:51.930
Well then, mission continues.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:54.030
Right.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:58.140
Kirisame Team reporting.

00:02:58.140 --> 00:02:59.440
We've reached Point F.

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:02.800
Murasame Team reporting.

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:04.070
We have reached Point P.

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:07.480
This is Hisame Team.
Have reached Point W.

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:12.310
Roger that. Head for
the target destination.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.460
What do you make of
the recent rumors

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:24.520
of suspicious activity in this area?

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:26.000
Rumors?

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:32.330
That Ninja from other land are
targeting Village Hidden in the Waterfall?

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:35.770
Such rumors have been around for ages.

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:41.510
That's right, your father also
battled Shinobi like that and...

00:03:51.590 --> 00:03:57.230
Don't worry. This is the Carrier Kite
from Hidden Leaf Village.

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:01.290
Oh boy... an emergency summons?

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.260
You're going?

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:07.840
Those guys can do the clean-up
here by themselves.

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:10.540
Hey guys!

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:14.740
Sorry, but I have to go
back to our village.

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:17.150
Did something happen?

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.620
It's an emergency meeting of Jonin.

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:22.750
You can follow later.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:24.090
Understood.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:30.890
You can leave the rest to Naruto here...
the one who'll inherit the Hokage's title!

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:33.570
Well then, take care of things here.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:41.600
Say, what's Hokage?

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:46.640
Hokage is the top Shinobi in
the Village Hidden in the Leaf.

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:51.150
To put it simply, he's the hero
who protects the land!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:52.520
Hmm...

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:55.650
Then he's just like Master Shibuki.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:57.380
Huh? Shibuki?

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.860
Hey, don't lump Hokages
together with that guy!

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:02.720
They're in a totally different class!

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:04.930
Don't make fun of Master Shibuki!

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.190
He may be a little cowardly,

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:10.700
but Master Shibuki is the hero
of Hidden Waterfall Village!

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:12.840
He's actually really strong!

00:05:14.510 --> 00:05:15.200
Huh?!

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:30.860
Aghhh! Dog poop!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:32.230
Yuck!

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:34.490
Who was it that pooped here?!

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:36.230
<i>What a loser.</i>

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:38.730
<i>An embarrassment to</i>
<i>Hidden Leaf Village!</i>

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:42.700
Damn! Why'd it happen to me?!

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:05.320
Can we really sneak in
from a place like this...

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:06.660
Master Suien?

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:13.430
Trust me... I used to be a Jonin
at Hidden Waterfall Village.

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:16.630
Let's go.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:19.470
Kirisame... No senseless killing.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.700
Kill only when necessary.

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:24.940
Humph... yessir.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:29.170
Is attacking your homeland
distasteful to you?

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:31.250
It's not that.

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:34.750
The only one who knows
the hiding place of the Hero's Water

00:06:35.090 --> 00:06:37.180
is Shibuki, the village leader.

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:43.460
And in order to make him talk,
it's necessary to take the villagers hostage.

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:45.230
Is that it?

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:48.300
Hmm... I must hand it to you, Hisame.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:51.900
No wonder you're rumored to be the
shrewdest Ninja in Hidden Rain Village.

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:54.210
That was long ago.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:58.640
Like you, we are Rogue Ninja now.

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:04.310
Whatever... let's just take over the village
and get a hold of the Hero's Water!

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:08.290
Well... Let's get the plan in motion.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:11.280
Sheesh... We're finished!

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:15.090
Man, I'm starving.

00:07:15.460 --> 00:07:17.730
It's a bit early, but let's eat our lunch!

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:20.730
No, if you're going to eat, go away!

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.000
W-What?!

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:25.460
What I mean is, if you're finished
with the job, just go home!

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:28.740
All right. We'll do that.

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:30.430
Huh? Sasuke!

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:33.380
Sasuke!

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:37.640
He doesn't want the entrance to
Hidden Waterfall Village to be discovered.

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:41.480
It's probably very near.

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:45.050
But Hidden Leaf and
Hidden Waterfall are allies.

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:47.460
So what if we know where
the entrance is?

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:48.460
Humph!

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:52.030
Well, can you say that
you'll never betray our village?

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:53.720
You're right.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:56.240
Hey! What a thing to say!

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:59.600
He's right! At least say thanks!

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:04.410
What? Hurry and go!

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:07.010
Hah! You don't need to tell me!

00:08:07.220 --> 00:08:09.650
We want nothing to do with
a place like this!

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.990
See you, Naruto!

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:14.850
Y-Yeah!

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:16.150
Mom!

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:18.290
What?!

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:23.890
Master Shibuki... it's terrible...

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:25.600
What happened?!

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:27.960
A-An enemy attack...

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:36.470
Mom!

00:08:43.180 --> 00:08:44.350
Her wound isn't deep.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.110
She just lost consciousness.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.910
We have to return to
the village immediately.

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:51.620
No, that's not wise.

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:54.120
She said enemy attack...

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:58.860
That's ridiculous.
H-How did they get to the village?

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:04.830
Sakura, take the kids and that woman
somewhere you can treat her wound.

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:05.770
Got that?

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:09.200
Yes. And what about you, Sasuke?

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:11.140
Mom!

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:16.620
Hey, Shibuki! Take us to
Hidden Waterfall Village!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:18.750
I'll get revenge for this kid.

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:22.850
Don't be ridiculous!
What can you do anyway?!

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.460
What're you doing?!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:27.560
Stay down!

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:28.820
Huh?!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:32.460
Gotcha!

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.940
Demon Wind Shuriken.

00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:47.240
Huh?!

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:02.760
Windmill of Shadows, huh?

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:07.890
We let him escape!

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:12.430
Hmm... Sasuke is <i>so</i> cool!

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:14.500
Master Shibuki!

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:16.030
Huh?

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:17.580
Master Shibuki?

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:20.680
Huh? It's nothing.

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:22.640
I'm just excited, that's all.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:27.250
Since we're involved now,
we'll see this to the end.

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:28.950
As our mission.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:31.930
We get to continue our mission!

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:35.550
"Seeing a tree and not climbing
isn't monkeylike."

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:39.560
The correct proverb is, "Seeing what
is right and not acting lacks courage."

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:43.470
Oh yeah, that.
Sakura, you're so smart.

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:50.770
Our Village Hidden in the Waterfall
has continued to exist

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:52.980
thanks to the natural surroundings
which form a barrier and

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:54.810
this waterfall which hides the entrance.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.580
An entrance... in a place like this?!

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:03.520
Let me make one thing clear...
Do not tell a soul about this entrance.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.680
We know!

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:22.870
Be careful, Naruto.

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:25.750
That's my line!

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:30.110
I don't sense any enemies.

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:36.250
This way.

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:39.590
Hurry it up!

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:44.420
Hey Sasuke...

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:45.790
We have no choice...

00:12:04.150 --> 00:12:06.380
All right. Now you can stop worrying.

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:09.220
Mom...!

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:11.750
Shizuku, don't cry.

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:14.690
Master Shibuki will do something.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:16.830
Yeah.

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.970
Now that will be interesting.

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:19.560
Huh?!

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:24.360
Sakura?!

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.310
With that skill level...

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:31.610
she's no match for me.

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:45.720
Wow!

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:07.370
I've never seen such a pretty place!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.480
<i>- Strange...</i>
- Too bad.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:12.180
I wish Sakura
could've seen this place.

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:22.360
<i>It's too quiet...!</i>

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:25.230
Huh?!

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:29.800
What was that for?!

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:33.630
I'll be the decoy,
so you take Shibuki to safety!

00:13:35.380 --> 00:13:36.280
Hurry it up!

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:37.580
G-Gotcha!

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:41.140
Huh? Shibuki?

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:48.480
Fire Style: Fireball Jutsu!

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:57.700
Hmm...

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.070
You're pretty good.

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.140
<i>I didn't sense her presence.</i>

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:07.100
<i>These guys are skilled!</i>

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:10.240
It won't be easy like earlier.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:13.350
Shall I cut you into pieces?

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:16.580
Hold on.

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:22.890
We'll use him to negotiate.

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:24.660
<i>Who is this?!</i>

00:14:35.940 --> 00:14:38.170
Humph, lucky kid.

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:42.110
So I wonder where the village leader,
Shibuki, has disappeared?

00:14:42.780 --> 00:14:44.440
Humph, it's obvious.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:48.780
He is probably headed to
the hiding place of the Hero's Water.

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:52.950
Hmm... I see.
We'll negotiate after that?

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:55.380
Absolutely.

00:15:44.610 --> 00:15:46.770
<i>I must never let them have this!</i>

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:50.570
<i>No matter what happens.</i>

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:05.550
Forget it.

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:08.750
That's my special Murasame wire.

00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:13.600
Try Escape Justsu unwisely,
and your arms will be cut off in an instant.

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:20.760
I brought them.

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:24.940
- Just as you ordered... the kids.
- Let us out, you!

00:16:25.410 --> 00:16:26.240
Good work.

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:29.440
Damn, what a bother!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:31.280
<i>Dammit...</i>

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:34.620
<i>So that's how they snuck</i>
<i>into the village.</i>

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:38.520
<i>That's...</i>

00:16:39.530 --> 00:16:40.360
<i>Suien?!</i>

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.520
<i>You guided them here?!</i>

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:47.840
Suien! You were once
this village's top Shinobi!

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:49.240
Why are you doing this?!

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:52.170
Do you intend to take
over this village?!

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:56.670
Hah! I have no use for
a rundown village like this.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:59.570
I want the Hero's Water.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:03.650
Ridiculous! As if Master Shibuki
will let you have it!

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:06.610
He's probably disposed of it by now!

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:10.890
A leader of the village would do that.

00:17:11.590 --> 00:17:16.550
But... I'm the one who taught him
the Ninja Arts.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:19.830
I know him inside and out.

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:23.060
Hey!

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:28.470
You...how did you get here?

00:17:30.180 --> 00:17:33.740
I was wandering around the roots...
and I ended up here.

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:38.240
But never mind that.
Just who are those guys?

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:43.580
The ringleader is a former
Hidden Waterfall Shinobi...named Suien.

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:47.050
Former? Then he's a Rogue Ninja?

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:48.390
Yeah...

00:17:49.230 --> 00:17:53.460
Hey Shibuki!
I know you're hiding somewhere.

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:55.430
Come on out!

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:59.470
Bring the Hero's Water here.

00:18:00.170 --> 00:18:04.370
Then this village will be spared
further suffering.

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:08.710
Is that the Hero's Water that
the guy's talking about?

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:14.780
Yes. Protecting this is the duty
of the leader of Hidden Waterfall Village.

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:17.620
It's just water!

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:21.300
This is sacred water...

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:24.860
squeezed out of the trunk of
this Sacred Tree once every 100 years.

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:31.260
Whoever drinks this can immediately
increase his Chakra several tenfold.

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:33.870
Increase your Chakra
several tenfold?!

00:18:34.610 --> 00:18:38.340
Hidden Waterfall Village has no Shinobi
who has earned the title of Kage.

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:39.950
In times of war,

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:42.820
the villagers drank this
Hero's Water and fought.

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:48.850
During the last great war,

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:52.020
Hidden Waterfall Village was
saved thanks to this water.

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:57.220
However, this Hero's Water
was a double-edged sword.

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:02.000
It shortened one's life by
the amount of Chakra that was increased.

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:08.370
Many of our Shinobi died not from war...
but from this water.

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:14.480
Since then, this Hero's Water was sealed
away to keep it out of people's hands.

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:17.480
And it became the duty of the leader to
protect it.

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:24.150
Several years ago, we came under attack
by Shinobi from other lands..

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:29.020
In order to protect the village,
my father drank this and fought.

00:19:30.930 --> 00:19:35.130
But... my father was not young enough
to withstand the increase of Chakra.

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:38.170
My father was a fool.

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:41.200
He was hailed as
the hero of the village...

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:44.210
and cajoled into drinking
this Hero's Water and die!

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:53.310
Shibuki, you wouldn't throw out
the Hero's Water now, would you?

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:56.620
If there should be another war,

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:00.720
without that, you cannot
protect the village, right?

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:09.160
I will protect the Hero's Water,
as the leader of this village!

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:11.730
If I hand it over to them,

00:20:12.510 --> 00:20:16.440
then this Village Hidden in the Waterfall
will be destroyed in an instant!

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:21.370
However... you're greatly mistaken
if you think you can hide it out.

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:24.780
If you don't hand over the Hero's Water,

00:20:24.850 --> 00:20:31.090
I'll kill the villagers here,
one by one...very slowly.

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:33.830
Don't come out, Master Shibuki!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:34.700
He's right!

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:37.720
Don't give them
the precious Hero's Water!

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:41.000
Shut up, brats!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:48.870
Damn it!
Shibuki, what're you doing?!

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:49.910
Quiet!

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:56.680
The kids all say...

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:00.890
that you're really strong, Shibuki...

00:21:01.720 --> 00:21:03.590
that you're the hero of this village!

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:08.790
They just have it in their heads...
that the leader of the village is a hero!

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:13.200
All I did was take over
after my father!

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:14.800
No!

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:17.130
- Shizuku!
- Don't!

00:21:18.940 --> 00:21:20.000
Shibuki!

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:24.180
You should know that
I'm very impatient.

00:21:25.080 --> 00:21:26.810
I'll wait one more minute.

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:33.010
If you don't come out by then,
I'll kill these kids one by one!

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:37.220
No! If you're going to
kill someone, take us first!

00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:40.860
That won't move Shibuki.

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:45.130
He always had a soft spot for the kids.

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:49.270
These kids will produce
the best results.

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:52.610
I don't understand it too much...

00:21:52.610 --> 00:21:56.940
But I think your pa was a great man.

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:00.980
What?! What would you understand?!

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:02.750
Twenty seconds left.

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:03.610
Huh?!

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:08.480
In order to save his village,
he was willing to give his life.

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:10.650
Not anyone can do that.

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:12.690
Ten more seconds!

00:22:12.960 --> 00:22:14.930
What're you going to do?!

00:22:15.530 --> 00:22:18.190
Anyone who can do
something like that...

00:22:22.170 --> 00:22:24.230
<i>has</i> to be a hero!

00:22:31.610 --> 00:22:34.480
3...2...1!

00:22:34.480 --> 00:22:35.280
Hold it!

00:22:42.120 --> 00:22:43.890
Naruto Uzumaki is here!

00:22:44.290 --> 00:22:46.660
Don't you dare touch those kids!

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:51.320
I'll show you!

00:22:52.670 --> 00:22:54.130
My secret technique!

00:22:54.740 --> 00:22:55.360
Huh?!

00:23:03.910 --> 00:23:05.740
W-What is it?

00:23:06.010 --> 00:23:07.340
Loser...

00:23:07.850 --> 00:23:09.910
<i>He's as uncool as ever...</i>

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:14.850
You fool... trying to act like a hero, huh?

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:17.920
I'm not acting!

00:23:18.230 --> 00:23:20.790
I'm really a hero!

00:23:21.360 --> 00:23:25.600
Humph! I don't want a wannabe hero.

00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:27.360
I want the Hero's Water.

00:23:29.600 --> 00:23:32.400
I guess I have no choice
but to kill this kid!

00:23:48.460 --> 00:23:49.750
Naruto!

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:53.460
<i>That guy...?!</i>

00:23:57.760 --> 00:23:58.790
Interesting...

00:23:59.530 --> 00:24:00.470
Let us see...

00:24:00.470 --> 00:24:03.930
your heroic skills.

00:24:06.070 --> 00:24:08.700
As if I'd lose to the likes of you!

00:24:09.380 --> 00:24:12.510
Kid, I wouldn't try anything foolish.

00:24:13.280 --> 00:24:17.150
This time, I <i>will</i> kill this kid
without a fail.

00:24:17.220 --> 00:24:18.010
No!

00:24:20.590 --> 00:24:24.180
Now then, just how strong...
is the hero?

00:24:30.500 --> 00:24:33.660
He's the one who was with Shibuki.

00:24:34.430 --> 00:24:37.700
If we torture him, he may tell us.

00:24:38.470 --> 00:24:39.960
As if I'd talk!

00:24:45.980 --> 00:24:48.040
What a hero you are.

00:24:55.020 --> 00:25:00.090
<i>He's a fool!</i>
<i>A big fool just like my old man!</i>

00:25:05.870 --> 00:25:07.930
I won't let you die yet.

00:25:09.100 --> 00:25:12.300
As if... I'm gonna die!

00:25:12.510 --> 00:25:13.370
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:25:13.810 --> 00:25:15.240
Stop already!

00:25:15.510 --> 00:25:17.540
Naruto will...die!

00:25:26.420 --> 00:25:27.320
That guy...

00:25:27.990 --> 00:25:31.580
Why? Why would he endure
so much for mere strangers?!

00:25:32.760 --> 00:25:36.460
<i>In order to save his village,</i>
<i>he was willing to give his life.</i>

00:25:36.860 --> 00:25:38.890
<i>Not anyone can do that.</i>

00:25:40.370 --> 00:25:42.100
<i>Anyone who can do</i>
<i>something like that...</i>

00:25:43.100 --> 00:25:44.730
<i>has to be a hero.</i>

00:25:53.150 --> 00:25:55.140
D-Damn it!

00:25:55.620 --> 00:25:58.050
Humph! What a foolish kid.

00:25:58.420 --> 00:26:00.150
You write it "hero"

00:26:01.050 --> 00:26:02.720
and read it "fool."

00:26:04.220 --> 00:26:05.990
Humph, yes...

00:26:07.030 --> 00:26:08.860
There's no hero!

00:26:09.400 --> 00:26:11.660
Since your father died...

00:26:12.000 --> 00:26:16.330
there's never been a hero in
Village Hidden the Waterfall!

00:26:19.870 --> 00:26:22.710
Sure there is!
Master Shibuki is a hero!

00:26:22.980 --> 00:26:24.570
Yes! That's right!

00:26:25.210 --> 00:26:28.510
Are you still saying that?!

00:26:28.920 --> 00:26:33.480
Master Shibuki will tear you
all to shreds!

00:26:33.790 --> 00:26:35.480
All to shreds!

00:26:36.990 --> 00:26:38.890
Shibuki's not a man like that.

00:26:39.530 --> 00:26:41.290
He's a weakling and a crybaby.

00:26:41.660 --> 00:26:44.530
A coward who always runs away!

00:26:44.600 --> 00:26:46.570
No, you're wrong!
You're wrong!

00:26:46.570 --> 00:26:49.400
Master Shibuki is our hero!

00:27:00.550 --> 00:27:04.180
Then you can die, hating that hero!

00:27:05.350 --> 00:27:09.880
Shibuki doesn't give a hoot
about your lives!

00:27:14.260 --> 00:27:14.920
Huh?!

00:27:24.300 --> 00:27:25.360
Impossible...

00:27:34.910 --> 00:27:36.940
Do not lay a hand on the villagers!

00:27:37.980 --> 00:27:41.280
I am...your opponent!

00:27:42.560 --> 00:27:43.850
- Master Shibuki!
- Master Shibuki!

00:27:44.090 --> 00:27:45.720
You did come, after all!

00:27:46.190 --> 00:27:48.630
Heh heh... not bad.

00:27:49.300 --> 00:27:51.360
You're so cool, Master Shibuki!

00:27:52.570 --> 00:27:54.160
<i>Such powerful Chakra...</i>

00:27:55.270 --> 00:27:57.570
<i>To be able to see it like that</i>
<i>with the naked eye!</i>

00:28:01.110 --> 00:28:03.470
Water Style - Water Dragon Missile!

00:28:19.760 --> 00:28:21.750
It's been a long time, Shibuki.

00:28:22.230 --> 00:28:24.060
You haven't changed a bit.

00:28:24.730 --> 00:28:28.570
That Chakra...
did you drink Hero's Water?

00:28:29.140 --> 00:28:30.690
Yes, I did.

00:28:31.270 --> 00:28:32.640
Where's the rest of it?

00:28:33.170 --> 00:28:34.540
You still have more, don't you?

00:28:35.210 --> 00:28:36.440
It's no use asking...

00:28:37.010 --> 00:28:39.840
Since I'm going to defeat you.

00:28:40.450 --> 00:28:42.640
Huh? Are you serious?

00:28:43.380 --> 00:28:45.320
Do you realize what will happen

00:28:45.320 --> 00:28:48.390
if someone of your skill
level drinks Hero's Water?

00:28:48.390 --> 00:28:50.950
You, of all people, should know.

00:28:51.460 --> 00:28:57.400
Not only that, even if you drink that,
your Chakra can never exceed mine!

00:28:57.960 --> 00:29:04.270
I have so much more
Chakra than what is inside you.

00:29:06.270 --> 00:29:07.430
Well, I'll do what I can.

00:29:09.280 --> 00:29:11.640
Hidden Waterfall Style!
Water-Cutting Blade!

00:29:23.560 --> 00:29:27.430
Your Chakra may have increased,
but your strokes are the same.

00:29:27.790 --> 00:29:29.590
You're wide open.

00:29:30.100 --> 00:29:31.590
It's my win!

00:29:55.020 --> 00:29:58.220
- Master Shibuki!
- Master Shibuki!

00:30:04.960 --> 00:30:07.200
Dammit...stand!

00:30:09.800 --> 00:30:17.340
I...must...protect...everyone...the kids!

00:30:18.040 --> 00:30:20.480
Hah! That's all you were.

00:30:21.610 --> 00:30:26.480
You'll always be a weak coward.

00:30:34.860 --> 00:30:36.560
It's just as I thought...

00:30:37.860 --> 00:30:40.830
I have it at last! The Hero's Water!

00:30:41.400 --> 00:30:43.270
I will be the greatest now!

00:30:45.000 --> 00:30:45.970
Give it back...!

00:30:58.520 --> 00:31:01.040
I'm just stepping on you...

00:31:01.290 --> 00:31:03.620
But did I just break your rib?

00:31:07.860 --> 00:31:09.760
Shibuki, be grateful!

00:31:10.560 --> 00:31:15.020
You will become my first prey...
of this most powerful self!

00:31:18.440 --> 00:31:19.910
Unforgivable...

00:31:21.140 --> 00:31:24.010
I won't let you get away with that!

00:31:24.580 --> 00:31:26.310
I'll smash you to bits!

00:31:28.780 --> 00:31:29.610
N-Naruto...

00:31:31.780 --> 00:31:33.580
Shadow Clone Jutsu!

00:31:35.690 --> 00:31:37.850
Uzu...ma...ki!

00:31:39.430 --> 00:31:41.520
<i>What?! He countered all my kicks?!</i>

00:31:42.030 --> 00:31:44.730
Up to silly tricks, huh, kid?!

00:31:45.200 --> 00:31:47.190
Well, I hope you're prepared!

00:31:53.340 --> 00:31:54.530
Dammit!

00:31:57.110 --> 00:31:57.940
When did he...?!

00:31:58.010 --> 00:31:59.070
Die!

00:32:05.050 --> 00:32:07.320
Naruto!

00:32:07.820 --> 00:32:09.790
First Master Shibuki...
and now Naruto!

00:32:10.960 --> 00:32:12.150
It's all over!

00:32:12.860 --> 00:32:14.050
Don't give up yet!

00:32:15.560 --> 00:32:17.930
If we give up, then it's all over.

00:32:24.140 --> 00:32:25.160
Shibuki?!

00:32:27.910 --> 00:32:30.380
Everyone will die at this rate...

00:32:31.640 --> 00:32:34.310
Take the kids and escape!

00:32:35.980 --> 00:32:38.780
Escape? No thanks.

00:32:40.020 --> 00:32:41.680
I'm gonna fight that guy!

00:32:44.220 --> 00:32:46.690
I'm overflowing with power!

00:32:47.660 --> 00:32:50.360
It's the effect of the Hero's Water...

00:32:51.560 --> 00:32:54.000
Huh? Another one?

00:32:54.570 --> 00:32:55.740
This way, Suien!

00:32:55.740 --> 00:32:56.500
Huh?!

00:33:00.540 --> 00:33:02.200
Humph, the fool!

00:33:02.410 --> 00:33:03.970
Huh?! When did...?!

00:33:08.950 --> 00:33:12.080
This tree has an opening at the top!

00:33:12.590 --> 00:33:14.990
Naruto! He still has
lots of power left.

00:33:15.090 --> 00:33:16.520
I know that.

00:33:18.830 --> 00:33:19.790
<i>So fast...!</i>

00:33:23.500 --> 00:33:25.400
I'll kill the both of you!

00:33:25.770 --> 00:33:27.390
Humph! Just try it.

00:33:28.800 --> 00:33:30.960
Fire Style-Phoenix Flower Jutsu!

00:33:40.650 --> 00:33:41.670
Wha--?!

00:33:44.650 --> 00:33:46.950
Don't get too confident
over something like that!

00:33:48.650 --> 00:33:52.150
Humph... You're the one
who's too confident.

00:33:52.690 --> 00:33:53.490
What?!

00:33:54.360 --> 00:33:58.090
Anyone who drinks Hero's Water
will become stronger.

00:33:58.970 --> 00:34:01.990
However, that's not true strength.

00:34:02.700 --> 00:34:05.170
The proof is...look...
you're already out of breath.

00:34:05.940 --> 00:34:08.240
Huh?! Shut up!

00:34:19.650 --> 00:34:20.590
Dammit...

00:34:20.690 --> 00:34:21.950
<i>What?</i>

00:34:22.620 --> 00:34:25.960
<i>Damn it! He didn't die from that?!</i>

00:34:26.760 --> 00:34:29.420
<i>The Hero's Water is losing</i>
<i>its effectiveness.</i>

00:34:29.960 --> 00:34:30.990
<i>Well then...</i>

00:34:43.440 --> 00:34:44.710
How's this?!

00:34:45.510 --> 00:34:46.670
No difference.

00:34:47.150 --> 00:34:47.880
What?!

00:34:54.350 --> 00:34:59.990
You're much more cowardly
than Shibuki...

00:35:00.330 --> 00:35:01.590
and weak.

00:35:03.100 --> 00:35:05.220
Shibuki had courage!

00:35:06.230 --> 00:35:09.200
And the strength to try to protect
the people of his village!

00:35:10.100 --> 00:35:12.600
But...you abandoned your village!

00:35:13.310 --> 00:35:16.040
And you only think of the
easy way to become strong!

00:35:16.540 --> 00:35:18.530
You're the pits!

00:35:19.250 --> 00:35:24.740
I... I... I'm not scared of
someone like you! Believe it!

00:35:30.320 --> 00:35:30.950
<i>Now!</i>

00:35:32.160 --> 00:35:34.060
Fire Style- Dragon Flame Jutsu!

00:35:41.370 --> 00:35:43.530
Huh?! The Hero's Water...!

00:35:48.240 --> 00:35:49.970
Naruto! End it with the next blow!

00:35:50.380 --> 00:35:51.710
I know that!

00:35:52.550 --> 00:35:54.810
Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!

00:35:57.980 --> 00:35:58.990
What?!

00:35:58.990 --> 00:36:00.750
Go!

00:36:01.120 --> 00:36:02.280
Dammit!

00:36:04.120 --> 00:36:05.280
As if...

00:36:05.730 --> 00:36:08.320
I'd let this happen!

00:36:13.570 --> 00:36:15.870
Take this!

00:36:39.190 --> 00:36:41.060
You did it, Naruto.

00:36:43.060 --> 00:36:45.050
Well... yeah.

00:36:52.470 --> 00:36:56.470
<i>Summer ended, and our mission</i>
<i>was completed successfully.</i>

00:36:57.880 --> 00:37:00.540
I see... so that happened?

00:37:01.180 --> 00:37:03.510
Well, well... that was rough.

00:37:03.750 --> 00:37:06.220
Sheesh... you said that with
no feeling at all.

00:37:06.690 --> 00:37:09.380
Say, Shibuki, is everything all right now?

00:37:10.020 --> 00:37:10.650
Yes.

00:37:11.220 --> 00:37:15.860
Yeah, but... he drank the Hero's Water
and he's fine!

00:37:16.430 --> 00:37:20.830
Shibuki is, without a doubt,
the hero of Village Hidden in the Waterfall!

00:37:21.870 --> 00:37:25.100
N-No... I was always a coward.

00:37:26.040 --> 00:37:29.410
Even back then,
I was overcome with fear.

00:37:30.140 --> 00:37:32.370
No such thing, Master Shibuki!

00:37:32.680 --> 00:37:36.270
Really! You were really
dashing back there!

00:37:36.950 --> 00:37:37.850
Thank you.

00:37:38.320 --> 00:37:39.110
Uh-huh!

00:37:40.550 --> 00:37:41.680
Yup! Yup!

00:37:42.960 --> 00:37:44.550
Well then, shall we be on our way?

00:37:45.290 --> 00:37:46.190
Yeah...

00:37:47.990 --> 00:37:49.050
Take care!

00:37:49.430 --> 00:37:53.560
Naruto, don't step on
doggie poo again!

00:37:53.870 --> 00:37:54.600
Huh?

00:37:56.000 --> 00:37:57.800
No way!

00:37:58.300 --> 00:38:02.640
The hero of Hidden Leaf Village
wouldn't be that clumsy!

00:38:13.050 --> 00:38:16.450
- Yuck!
- How disgusting!
